      "tolerance": 0,
      "source": "(q;q)_n (q^-1;q^-1)_n = prod (1-q^j)(1-q^-j) = prod (2 - q^j - q^-j) = (-1)^n prod f_j, the bar-even tower of MuPCarrierBarParity. Max |difference| over n <= 8 at the off-anchor point q = 1.37 is 8.1139e-69. Scope-(b), exact algebra: the bar-even precondition — which the corpus ARGUES from 4_1 amphichirality and does not prove — is automatic for any Habiro-ring element expanded in its own basis."
