      "computed": "1",
      "expected": "1",
      "passed": true,
      "tolerance": 0,
      "source": "I(Sigma(2,3,5); 1/q0) = 14.917498476497690554, last term 8.308e-19 by n = 399; at q0 > 1 the partial sum reaches -9.18943e+246 after 60 terms. So the evaluation regime this route uses is the convergent one, and HabiroMagnitudeA3.pochAbs_unbounded — stated for 1 < q, and additionally requiring |a_n| >= 1 — does not reach it."
    }
